---
layout: landing.njk
title: Module Shelf | Ionrift Workshop
description: Install Ionrift Foundry modules you are entitled to. Public manifests and personal Patreon install links.
canonical: https://ionrift.cloud/module-shelf/
ogTitle: Module Shelf
ogDescription: One place for Foundry module install links. Connect Patreon for premium modules.
ogImage: https://ionrift.cloud/img/shelf/header.jpg
bodyClass: page-overlay-shelf page-module-shelf
---

{% include "landing/nav.njk" %}

<main class="page-main page-overlay-shelf page-module-shelf">
    <div class="container">
        <nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <a href="/#modules">Modules</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span>Module Shelf</span>
        </nav>

        <header class="shelf-hero-split">
            <div class="shelf-hero-copy">
                <div class="section-label">Installs</div>
                <h1 class="shelf-hero-title">Module Shelf</h1>
                <p class="shelf-hero-lead">
                    Foundry module install links in one place. Free modules use a public manifest.
                    Premium modules unlock a personal install link after you Connect Patreon.
                    Paste the link into Foundry Add-on Modules.
                </p>
                <div class="shelf-hero-actions">
                    <div class="shelf-hero-cta">
                        <span id="module-shelf-auth-slot" class="shelf-auth-slot"></span>
                        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/overlay-shelf/">Overlay Shelf</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="shelf-note shelf-hero-hint" id="module-shelf-note" hidden></p>
            </div>
            <div class="shelf-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
                <img src="/img/shelf/header.jpg" alt="" width="720" height="405" decoding="async">
            </div>
        </header>

        <section class="shelf-section shelf-section--tight" aria-labelledby="module-shelf-list-heading">
            <div class="shelf-section-head">
                <h2 id="module-shelf-list-heading" class="shelf-h2 visually-hidden">Modules</h2>
            </div>
            <div id="module-shelf-list" class="module-shelf-groups" aria-live="polite">
                <p class="shelf-loading">Loading modules...</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <p class="page-back">
            <a href="/#modules">&larr; All modules</a>
            ·
            <a href="/overlay-shelf/">Overlay Shelf</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</main>

{% include "landing/footer.njk" %}

<script type="application/json" id="module-shelf-catalog">{{ moduleShelfCatalog | jsonEncode | safe }}</script>
<script type="module" src="/js/module-shelf.js"></script>
